# The repo is authored on Windows but eslint-config-athom requires LF, which
# produced roughly 2500 linebreak-style errors and a permanent phantom "M" on
# app.json after every `homey app validate`. Normalise on the way in.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Anything below is byte-for-byte, never touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
*.raw binary
